BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Local Government Night with Jim Schutz\, Mai-Ling Garcia\, & Tonia
  Lediju
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T210000
DTSTAMP:20261118T115305Z
UID:funcheap-1646111@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lectures Workshops
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJoin us at Book Passage Corte 
 Madera for Local Government Night—an evening that brings the inner worki
 ngs of local government to life through poetry\, storytelling\, and conver
 sation.\nJim Schutz\, former San Rafael city manager and author of The May
 or Has a Hammer\, will read poems capturing the human side of public servi
 ce. He is joined by Mai-Ling Garcia\, a Senior Visiting Fellow in Technolo
 gy & Democracy at New America\, and Tonia Lediju\, Executive Director of t
 he Marin Housing Authority. The evening includes readings\, discussion\, a
 nd audience Q&A.\n****\n\nABOUT THIS EVENT\n\nThis event will be hosted by
