BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art of the American West: San Francisco Yarn Art Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T160000
DTSTAMP:20261117T035757Z
UID:funcheap-1647547@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:SFArtsEd\n\nJoin Bay Area–raised\, Los Angeles–based conte
 mporary artist Amadour for a free\, all-ages art workshop in San Francisco
  exploring geometric abstraction\, Land Art\, and the landscapes of the Am
 erican West. This hands-on family workshop invites visitors of all ages to
  discover the connections between contemporary art\, nature\, and creative
  expression.\nThrough a lively art history presentation\, participants wil
 l learn about the work of influential artists of the American West\, inclu
 ding Agnes Martin\, Nancy Holt\, and Michael Heizer\, exploring how artist
 s have transformed landscapes through geometry\, abstraction\, and large-s
 cale interventions in nature.\nFollowing the presentation\, participants w
 ill experiment with line\, shape\, color\, and space through interactive a
 ctivities and hands-on yarn art-making\, creating their own abstract lands
 capes to take home.\n\nAmadour is an artist\, writer\, and musician raised
  in Reno\, Nevada\, and Sausalito\, California\, with Mexican and Colombia
 n roots. Their interdisciplinary practice explores geometric abstraction\,
  architecture\, landscape\, and the cultural histories of the American Wes
 t.\nTheir work has been exhibited internationally\, including at KOTARO NU
 KAGA in Tokyo\, The Armory Show in New York\, and FF Projects in Mexico. I
 n 2026\, they presented Amadour: Nevada Proscenium\, a solo exhibition at 
 Truckee Meadows Community College in Reno. Their forthcoming solo museum e
 xhibition\, Amadour: The Mapes Suite\, opens at the Nevada State Museum in
  De...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.sfartsed.org/event/3rdsaturdayworks
 hops/?wcs_timestamp=1795269600\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/art-ameri
 can-west-san-francisco-yarn-art-workshop/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/AMADOU
 R_SF_ARTS_EDUCATION_PROJECT.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261117T035757Z
LOCATION:Minnesota Street Project\, 1275 Minnesota St\, San Francisco\, CA
  94107
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/art-american-west-san-francisco-yarn-art-works
 hop/
END:VEVENT
