SUMMARY:Incredible Sugar Castle At The Westin St. Francis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T120000
DTSTAMP:20261122T194955Z
UID:funcheap-1648131@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Kids Families
DESCRIPTION:The Westin St. FrancisA San Francisco holiday tradition turns 
 21 this year! Executive Pastry Chef Jean-François Houdré and his team pr
 oudly unveil the nearly 12-foot-tall Sugar Castle\, a dazzling\, handcraft
 ed replica of a French château that has delighted visitors since 2005.\nT
 his beloved holiday masterpiece weighs more than 1\,000 pounds and feature
 s more than 20 towers\, approximately 15 illuminated rooms\, and a working
  train\, bringing a whimsical French château to life in the heart of Unio
 n Square.\nNew This Year: “Can You Find San Francisco?”\nGet ready for
  a San Francisco treasure hunt! Hidden throughout the Sugar Castle is a re
 plica of the hotel’s beloved dog mascot\, Francis\, as well as miniature
  versions of some of the city’s most iconic landmarks\, brought to life 
 with custom-designed ornaments generously donated by San Francisco Mercant
 ile. From the Golden Gate Bridge to a classic cable car\, guests can find 
 them all\, collect the letters\, and unscramble the secret word to claim a
  prize. It’s a playful way for visitors of all ages to discover a little
  more of San Francisco tucked inside the castle.\n\nSugar Castle Puzzles\n
 The magic of the Sugar Castle can live on long after the holidays. A one-o
 f-a-kind\, custom-made Sugar Castle puzzle captures the intricate details 
 of this beloved San Francisco tradition\, inviting visitors to recreate th
 e spectacular confectionery masterpiece piece by piece at home. Available 
 for purchase at Café Rito\, it’s a keepsake from one of the city’s...
 \n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/sfouw-the-westi
 n-st-francis-san-francisco-on-union-square/experiences/holidays/\nDetails:
  https://sf.funcheap.com/incredible-sugar-castle-westin-st-francis-sf/\nSo
 urce: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Sugar-
 CAstle-.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T194955Z
LOCATION:The Westin St. Franics\, 335 Powell Street\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/incredible-sugar-castle-westin-st-francis-sf/
END:VEVENT
