 m Yousif\nDecember 3\, 2026–February 14\, 2027\n\nThacher Gallery\, Univ
 ersity of San Francisco\nFive Bay Area artists explore questions of inheri
 tance from those who came before us–in our bodies\, in our materials\, a
 nd in our shared record–and what we make of what we choose to keep.\n\nP
 resented by the MA in Museum Studies program in collaboration with guest c
 urator and instructor Deena Chalabi. What We Carry is on view in Thacher G
 allery from. Closed Dec. 19-20\, and Dec. 24-Jan. 3.\nLocated in USF’s G
