DESCRIPTION:Into the Streets + Civic Joy Fund Present\nDowntown First Thur
 sdays\nThursday\, December 3 | Market & 2nd\n\nDFT is Downtown SF's FREE m
 assive monthly street party! DJs\, live performances\, dancing\, drag\, fo
 od trucks\, shopping\, and all ages fun every first Thursday of the month.
 .\n\nDecember 3rd Special Guest Performer:\nTBA very soon!\n\nExplore thre
 e blocks of fun on 2nd St. between Market and Howard Streets!\n\nWe strong
 ly recommend taking public transportation:\nThe nearest public transit sta
 tion is Montgomery Station (MUNI & BART)\n\nHoward Stage Happy Hour\nJoin 
 the Howard Stage happy hour every month from 5-7PM at Howard and 2nd St\, 
 featuring house-party vibes in the streets. It's your post-work pick-me-up
 !\n\nPlus... Happy Hour Specials at all outdoor bars from 5-7PM ONLY:\n\n$
 8 Beers\n$10 Wines\n$12 Margs\n\n__________\n\nRSVP Deals:\n\n$3 off featu
 red Specialty Cocktails at all DFT outdoor bars on 2nd St.\nRise over Run 
 at the Timbri Hotel: Kick off Downtown First Thursdays at Rise Over Run! S
