  Plaza\, bringing holiday magic to San Francisco’s waterfront.\nBring th
 e whole family\, throw on your favorite ugly sweater\, and get ready for a
 n evening filled with holiday cheer! Enjoy live music from The Death & Tax
 es Swing Band\, festive specials throughout The PIER\, and a magical visit
  from the North Pole. Plus\, take advantage of PIER 39’s Entertainment Z
 one\, where visitors can enjoy alcoholic beverages outdoors in designated 
 areas while soaking up the festive atmosphere.\nPIER 39’s Annual Tree Li
 ghting Celebration\nThursday\, December 3\, 2026 | 5-9p\nPier 39\, The Emb
 arcadero\, SF\nFREE\nNEW this year: Let it snow at PIER 39! For the first 
 time ever\, experience the magic of snowfall at The PIER as we celebrate t
 he annual tree lighting tradition with an extra touch of winter wonder.\nM
 ake a day of it by exploring PIER 39’s festive holiday décor\, capturin
 g picture-perfect memories\, and shopping for unique gifts for everyone on
  your holiday list. Plus\, with NEW all-day $15 flat-rate parking\, you ca
 n enjoy the festivities without feeling rushed! Start at The PIER and make
  it your home base for exploring holiday celebrations throughout San Franc
 isc...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.pier39.com/holidayseason/#tree-ligh
