SUMMARY:Artist Talk with Klea McKenna
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T190000
DTSTAMP:20261118T115305Z
UID:funcheap-1647158@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerKlea McKennaJoin us on Decembe
 r 3rd at 6pm for an artist talk with 2025–26 Kala Fellow Klea McKenna. M
 cKenna will share the process of making her installation The Remedy–both
  how she makes large shaped-plate intaglio prints using cardboard plates
 –as well as her writing and illustration process. In this work Klea bega
 n with the seed of a family story\, passed down to her by her maternal lin
 e. Using writing and illustration exercises she grew it into a written sho
 rt story and then a mixed media installation. Klea will share her methods 
 for moving between memory\, writing\, research and visual imagery. The Rem
 edy is on view in the Kala Gallery as part of What We Hold\, New Works by 
 Kala’s 2025-2026 Kala Fellowship artists.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://ww
 w.kala.org/event/artist-talk-with-klea-mckenna/\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/artist-talk-klea-mckenna/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Untitl
 ed-1-Recovered.jpg
