DESCRIPTION:IlluminOdyssey 10: Interactive Glowing Science Adventure (Nov.
  14-Jan. 24)\nCuriOdyssey\n10 years. 10 new exhibits. One glowing holiday 
 journey into the science of light. Catch the light: November 14\, 2026 –
  January 24\, 2027.\nInspired by the science of light\, IlluminOdyssey is 
 an immersive\, interactive installation that will mesmerize kids and adult
 s of all ages.\nCuriOdyssey’s four-level Redwood Hall will transform int
 o a glowing forest of science—light your way through a maze of luminous 
 botanical geometry\, play with rainbow refraction and swirling projections
 \, paint with light on phosphorescent surfaces\, and dance with your shado
 w.\nExplore the physical properties of light\, such as photoluminescence\,
  color\, additive light mixing\, waves\, fluorescence\, fluid dynamics\, s
 ubtractive color mixing\, and refraction.\nIlluminOdyssey 10\nNovember 14 
 – January 24\, 2027 | 9:30a – 4:30p\nCuriOdyssey\, 1651 Coyote Point D
 r.\, San Mateo\nTickets at $29.95 GA\; Free for CuriOdysse members\n* Plea
 se note: This is a darkened hall with a variety of light-based exhibits an
 d artwork. Visitors sensitive to light and sound may be affected. Learn mo
 re in our IlluminOdyssey Social Story.\nIlluminOdyssey is celebrating 10 y
 ears the only way we know how: bigger and better than ever. This milestone
  year brings 10 new glowing exhibits packed into Redwood Hall\, with belov
 ed favorites alongside dazzling new additions. This fan-favorite exhibitio
 n is free with admission or membership.\nCuriOdyssey’s hands-on approach
  t...\n\n$29.95\n\nTickets: https://curiodyssey.org/illuminodyssey10/?utm_
 source=SFFunCheap&amp\;utm_medium=event+listing&amp\;utm_id=IlluminOdyssey
 10\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/illuminodyssey-10-interactive-glowing
 -science-adventure-nov-14-jan-24/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/mylar-
 light.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261120T202853Z
LOCATION:CuriOdyssey\, 1651 Coyote Point Dr. San Mateo\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/illuminodyssey-10-interactive-glowing-science-
 adventure-nov-14-jan-24/
END:VEVENT
