DESCRIPTION:Daniel O'DriscollDeck the lane and give back.\nShotski’s is 
 turning Claude Lane into a free holiday dance party for One Simple Wish\, 
 a nonprofit that grants wishes and gives support to kids and young people 
 in foster care.\nThe night is organized by DJ Driddle (Daniel O’Driscoll
 ). He grew up in the foster system himself and has wanted to raise money f
 or this cause for a long time. He’s bringing six DJs\, there’ll be sea
 sonal cocktails from The Merriest\, Shotski’s annual Christmas pop-up\, 
 and a crowd that’s out to give.\n\nEntry is free. Every donation goes di
 rectly to One Simple Wish.\nGive ahead of time: onesimplewish.org/giving/g
 iveuntilgone\nOr scan the QR code at the party\nLineup\n5–6 PM: Tvb (@te
 ahvanbergen)\, house\n6–7 PM: Rickstar (@its.reallycharlie)\, garage/tec
 h house\n7–8 PM: Ben Rubin (@itsbeenrubin)\, house/disco\n8–9 PM: Spre
 ki (@spreki)\, UKG/hard house\n9–10 PM: Mvrdok (@mvrdok)\, speed garage/
 hard house\n10–11 PM: Driddle (@driddle.music)\, euro dance/hard house\n
 Come dance\, drink something festive and help make a kid’s wish come tru
 e. ❤️\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/sleigh-it-forwa
 rd-give-until-gone-free-charity-block-party-tickets-2005096007133?aff=oddt
 dtcreator&amp\;keep_tld=true\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sleigh-give
 -free-charity-block-party-claude-lane-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_83
 15.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T194955Z
LOCATION:Shotski's Alpine Lodge\, 239 Kearny St. San Francisco 94108
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sleigh-give-free-charity-block-party-claude-la
 ne-sf/
