SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:“Let’s Glow SF” 2026: SF’s Huge Holiday Projection Art
 s Festival (Dec. 4-13)\nDowntown San Francisco Partnership\nLet’s Glow S
 F\, the nation’s largest free holiday projection arts festival\, is ligh
 ting up downtown San Francisco once again for its sixth and brightest year
  yet.\nThis all-ages\, family-friendly festival runs for 10 dazzling night
 s from December 4-13\, 2026. Experience breathtaking animated projections 
 illuminating iconic buildings across downtown San Francisco\, transforming
  them into colossal\, colorful canvases featuring spectacular artwork by 1
 9 artists from around the globe. It’s a larger-than-life holiday light s
 how that turns the heart of the city into an open-air art gallery after da
 rk.\n\n2026 Let’s Glow SF Festival Showtimes\n\nFriday\, December 4: Cou
 ntdown to Glow opening-night celebration\, 6-7pm at Harry Bridges Plaza in
  front of the Ferry Building.\nFriday\, December 4: Festival projections\,
  7-10pm.\nDecember 5-13: Nightly projections\, 5:30-10pm.\n\n2026 Show Loc
 ations (map)\n\nFerry Building (1 Ferry Building) – Best viewed from Har
 ry Bridges Plaza.\n101 California St. (101 California St.) – Best viewed
  from inside 101 California Plaza.\nPacific Exchange (301 Pine St.) – Be
 st viewed from 300 Pine Street.\nHobart Building (582 Market St.) – Best
  viewed from 1 Post Street.\nYerba Buena Lane (Market St.) – Best viewed
  from Yerba Buena Lane off Market Street.\nSalesforce Tower (415 Mission S
 t.) – Best viewed from anywhere in downtown.\n\nLGSF Business Specials\n
 Participating down...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.downtownsf.org/event
 s/letsglowsf/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/lets-glow-sf-2026-sfs-huge
 -holiday-projection-arts-festival-dec-4-13/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Lets-G
 low-SF.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T012711Z
LOCATION:San Francisco’s Financial District\, Market at Sutter Street\, 
 San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/lets-glow-sf-2026-sfs-huge-holiday-projection-
 arts-festival-dec-4-13/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Haunted Hearth: Paxton Gate’s 34th Annual Holiday Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T210000
DTSTAMP:20261028T130710Z
UID:dothebay-18002727@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Holiday Event
DESCRIPTION:It’s back! Our annual holiday party is on the books\, and yo
 u’re all invited. Why are we throwing a party\, you may ask? Are we just
  big fans of the holiday season? Well\, yes\, but we’re also celebrating
  Paxton Gate’s 34th anniversary. This year\, we’re leaning into the sl
 ightly darker folklore surrounding the holiday season (hence the Haunted H
 earth theme)\, and we’ve asked a very special someone to join us. More o
 n that later.\nSomehow\, 34 years of Paxton Gate is just as mind-blowing t
 o us as 33 was. That’s 34 years of bringing oddities\, fossils\, mineral
 s\, plants\, and all sorts of other “Wait\, what is that?” stuff to Va
 lencia Street. As jazzed as we are to keep doing what we do\, we really co
 uldn’t do any of it without you\, our super rad customers and neighbors 
 up and down Valencia Street.\nTo show y’all just how much we appreciate 
 you\, we throw an annual holiday party\, and we’d love for you to attend
 . We’ll have drinks\, finger foods\, live music\, and this year\, a very
  special horned\, legendary\, and somewhat horrifying guest. Don’t worry
 \, though. He’s promised not to hit anyone with his bundle of birch bran
 ches. Why he insists on carrying those around is anyone’s guess.\nAnyway
 s\, join us for a night of merrymaking\, holiday cheer\, and hanging out w
 ith a demon summoned from the depths of the North Pole.\nWe’ll see y’a
 ll there.\n\nFree\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/5/haunte
 d-hearth-paxton-gate-s-34th-annual-holiday-party-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7596242;-122.4217046
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35166855/a52a9137-113d-4a1d-98b3-91058ee73d45.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T130710Z
LOCATION:Paxton Gate\, 824 Valencia Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/5/haunted-hearth-paxton-gate-s-34t
 h-annual-holiday-party-tickets
END:VEVENT
