DESCRIPTION:Join us for our second annual Winter Faire! We’re excited to
  have you be a part of this tradition. Celebrate the season with kids’ m
 usic\, crafts\, and activities\, as well as holiday tunes by local musicia
 ns. Take a candle making or succulent wreath workshop in the afternoon. En
 joy a complimentary hot chocolate from The Quenched Trailer and soak in th
 e festive atmosphere. Shop our collection of locally sourced gifts and hol
 iday decor. We’ll be donating 5% of all pretax sales to Food Bank of Con
 tra Costa & Solano all day!\n\nSunday\, December 6\nConcord Schedule of Ev
 ents:\nAll Festivities from 10:00am to 3:00pm\n10:00am to 3:00pm Kids Club
  Activities\n10:30am Music Time with Farmer Arann\n11:30pm Live Holiday Mu
 sic from Local Musicians\n1:00pm Candle Making Workshop ($45). Please call
  the store to sign up (925) 681-0550\n2:00pm Create a Succulent Wreath Wor
 kshop ($115). Please call the store to sign up (925) 681-0550\nKids Club A
 ctivities including coloring\, ornament making\, scavenger hunts and more!
 \n\nCheckout the other Winter Faire dates:\n11/22 Novato\n12/13 Sloat Blvd
 \, SF\n\nPublished by Sloat Garden Center\nContains information from CalDi
 scovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sloatgardens.com
 /event/concord-winter-faire-2026/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&u
 tm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
