 t Glühwein at Hunters Point Shipyard.\nMore than 60 artists open their st
 udios in Building 101\, and the Shipyard Gallery hosts artists from across
  the Shipyard and Islais Creek Studios. Wander the halls\, meet the artist
 s where they work\, and find gifts you won’t see anywhere else.\nIn the 
 gallery: hot German Glühwein\, spiced cider and German holiday cookies. C
 hildren and dogs are welcome. Stop by and say hello to the show’s volunt
 eer organizers\, artists Carolyn Crampton\, Maeve Croghan and Kim Smith.\n
