SUMMARY:Chanukah Around the World Family Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T190000
DTSTAMP:20261120T202853Z
UID:caldiscovery-festival-1cdcc7147d8c986d@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us at JCC East Bay for our Chanukah Around the World Cele
 bration for the first time ever in our brand new Rockridge location!\nJust
  as the sun sets\, we will gather together to try celebratory foods from d
 ifferent countries\, learn about important customs and traditions from Jew
 ish communities around the world\, and participate in a communal chanukiya
 h lighting! You can expect to make your own hanging menorahs like Morrocan
  and Indian-Jews\, learn how dreidel is played in Israel\, hand-press oliv
 es like Jewish communities in Italy do\, and so much more!\nEnjoy live mus
 ic by Lior Ben-Hur and his band\, Music By Heart!\nPlus\, even more fun wi
 th Wilderness Torah\, Olamim \, Eden Village West\, PJ Library\, Camp Tawo
 nga\, Oakland Hebrew Day School and Contra Costa Jewish Day School!\nThis 
 Chanukah program is geared toward children ages 2-8\, but all are welcome!
 \nThis will be an outdoor event so we suggest bundling yourself and your l
 ittle one for comfort!\n\nPublished by Jewish Federation Bay Area\nContain
 s information from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: 
 https://jewishfed.org/event/chanukah-around-the-world-family-festival/?utm
 _source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource:
  CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261120T202853Z
LOCATION:East Bay Jewish Community Campus\, 5957 Chabot Road\, Oakland\, 9
 4618\, United States
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://jewishfed.org/event/chanukah-around-the-world-family-festival/
 ?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
