  tasting experience with Museion Napa\nCatered hors d’oeuvres with a spe
 cialty Hog Island Oyster Co. bar\n\nEvent details\n\nGuests must be 21+ ye
 ars of age.\nTicket includes access to Azzedine Alaïa: Sculpting Fashion 
 and the Legion o...\n\n$45\, 21+\n\nTickets: https://www.famsf.org/events/
