DESCRIPTION:After Dark: Solstice\nThursday\, December 17 | Exploratorium\,
  Pier 15\n\nHow do the changing seasons affect us? As the days grow shorte
 r and nights get longer\, come celebrate winter solstice at the Explorator
 ium After Dark. Play with light and shadow\, dive into traditions around t
 he world\, and encounter artworks inspired by the darkest night of the yea
 r. Don’t forget to bask in the radiance of Glow\, our seasonal exhibitio
 n bringing brand-new artworks to Pier 15.\n\nAfter Dark Thursday Nights\nT
 his event is part of our After Dark Thursday Nights series. Unplug and pla
 y with 700+ interactive exhibits exploring science\, art\, and perception.
  Learn more.\n\n6–10 p.m.\nAdults Only (Ages 18+)\nThe Exploratorium\, P
 ier 15\, San Francisco\n\n18+\n\nTickets: https://www.exploratorium.edu/vi
 sit/calendar/after-dark-solstice\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/202
 6/12/17/after-dark-solstice-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
