 tails can change after they are added to our calendar\, and errors...\n\nF
 ree\n\nTickets: http://www.eco-sf.org\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/ec
 o-sf-school-farm-volunteer-work-day-sf-167/\nSource: Funcheap SF
